<title>GERMANY: ProSieben shares surge in grey market.</title>
<headline>ProSieben shares surge in grey market.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in German television broadcaster ProSieben Media AG on Monday surged in grey market dealings after the group released the bookbuilding range price for its initial share offering.</p>
<p>ProSieben shares were bid at 100 marks ($57.87) and offered at 110 marks, according to broker Schnigge+Partner GmbH of Duesseldorf.</p>
<p>The bookbuilding range for ProSieben, announced earlier on Monday, was set at 66 to 72 marks per preference share. ($ = 1.727 German Marks)</p>
